WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.904
MyCampusView Academy.

2
00:00:02.954 --> 00:00:06.490
AI for Young Builders, video 13.

3
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:11.310
Responsible AI: privacy, deepfakes and you.

4
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.649
AI is a powerful tool.

5
00:00:14.699 --> 00:00:19.146
Like any tool, it can be used well or badly.

6
00:00:19.196 --> 00:00:21.190
The choice is yours.

7
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:23.804
First, privacy.

8
00:00:23.854 --> 00:00:27.368
AI apps may keep what you type or upload.

9
00:00:27.418 --> 00:00:33.365
So share as little as possible, and never share other people’s photos

10
00:00:33.415 --> 00:00:36.060
or details without asking them.

11
00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:38.639
Second, truth.

12
00:00:38.689 --> 00:00:44.748
AI can make deepfakes: fake photos, videos and voices of real people.

13
00:00:44.798 --> 00:00:50.414
Shocking content is made to spread fast, so slow down before you

14
00:00:50.464 --> 00:00:52.450
believe it or share it.

15
00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.630
Use the word STOP.

16
00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:58.631
Source: who posted it first?

17
00:00:58.681 --> 00:01:00.239
Too surprising?

18
00:01:00.289 --> 00:01:01.311
Slow down.

19
00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:09.352
Odd details: strange hands, blurry edges, lips that do not match the words.

20
00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:14.069
Proof: can you find it on two trusted sites?

21
00:01:14.119 --> 00:01:16.320
If not, do not share.

22
00:01:17.650 --> 00:01:18.886
Third, honesty.

23
00:01:18.936 --> 00:01:24.973
Using AI for ideas or explanations is fine when your teacher allows it.

24
00:01:25.023 --> 00:01:29.517
Copying its answers and calling them your own is not.

25
00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:34.490
Write in your own words, and say when and how you used AI.

26
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.216
Let us recap.

27
00:01:37.266 --> 00:01:41.986
Share as little personal information as possible.

28
00:01:42.036 --> 00:01:46.173
STOP and check before you believe or share.

29
00:01:46.223 --> 00:01:50.164
Use AI honestly and never to hurt anyone.

30
00:01:50.214 --> 00:01:54.740
Next: Final project: build and present your AI.
